  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHBC714C34E2563990FBA597531E822A65" xlink:label="HHBC714C34E2563990FBA597531E822A65" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH9839B822D33F9DC03398EB8B0E3636FB" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>As of March 31, 2026, Thor Nielson became the Senior Advisor &#8211; Finance of the Company and Michael Doherty, Vice President Finance, and Uriel Avila, Treasurer, were appointed as officers of the Company.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHBC714C34E2563990FBA597531E822A65" xlink:to="HH9839B822D33F9DC03398EB8B0E3636FB" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH2FC1B4CCD69A87484BF4006CC5C0C142" xlink:label="HH2FC1B4CCD69A87484BF4006CC5C0C142" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHCF6E9AD520B7789E0A41C14033E4EF4A" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Non-cash financing activities: An affiliate receivable of $19,354,163 was forgiven and cleared as a distribution to the Parent in 2025.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
